  "2026-09-03T18:06:37.336Z","harness:codex","GitHub source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1185. All-status duplicate check searched discarded value, hash-only, merge report, and value availability. pm-z1z96w shipped truthful proof-backed reconciliation for hash-only receipts and pm-rh98vo shipped durable receipt discovery, but their live resolutions do not provide a readable discarded value. This report is a recurrence/boundary extension and receives a new item linked to both shipped lineages."
